        },
        {
          "text": " Naye Yoabu akamwambia Amasa, Amani kwako, ndugu yangu. Kisha Yoabu akamshika Amasa ndevu kwa mkono wake wa kulia ili ambusu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.20.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.20.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 20:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Wala Amasa hakuangalia huo upanga uliomo mkononi mwa Yoabu; basi akampiga nao tumboni, akamwaga matumbo yake chini, asimpige mara ya pili; naye akafa. Kisha Yoabu na Abishai, nduguye, wakamfuata Sheba, mwana wa Bikri. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.20.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.20.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 20:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Akasimama karibu naye mmoja wa vijana wa Yoabu, huyo akasema, Ampendaye Yoabu, na aliye wa Daudi, na amfuate Yoabu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.20.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.20.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 20:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Lakini Amasa alikuwa anagaagaa katika damu yake katikati ya njia kuu. Basi yule mtu alipowaona watu wote wamesimama, akamwondoa Amasa toka njia kuu akamtia kondeni, akamfunika nguo, hapo alipoona ya kuwa kila mtu aliyefika kwake amesimama. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.20.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.20.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 20:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Na alipoondolewa katika njia kuu, watu wote wakapita, wakamwandama Yoabu ili kumfuatia Sheba, mwana wa Bikri. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.20.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.20.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 20:14"
