        },
        {
          "text": " Na hao wakaja wakauzingira katika Abeli wa Bethmaaka, wakafanya kilima mbele ya mji, nacho kikasimama kuielekea ngome; na watu wote waliokuwa pamoja na Yoabu wakavunjavunja ukuta, wapate kuubomoa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.20.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.20.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 20:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ndipo akalia mwanamke mmoja mwenye hekima toka mjini, Sikieni, sikieni; mwambieni na Yoabu, aje hapa karibu, niseme naye. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.20.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.20.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 20:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Basi akamkaribia; na yule mwanamke akasema, Ndiwe Yoabu? Akajibu, Ndimi. Ndipo akamwambia Sikia maneno ya mjakazi wako. Akajibu, Mimi nasikia. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.20.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.20.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 20:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kisha akanena, akisema, Watu hunena zamani za kale, wakisema, Wasikose kuuliza huko Abeli; ndivyo walivyoleta suluhu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.20.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.20.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 20:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "1SA.26.19"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "1 Sam 26:19",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Mimi ni mmoja wa hao wenye amani, walio waaminifu katika Israeli; wewe unataka kuuharibu mji ulio kama mama wa Israeli; mbona unataka kuumeza urithi wa BWANA? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.20.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.20.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 20:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yoabu akajibu, akasema, Isiwe, isiwe kwangu, niumeze wala kuuharibu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.20.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.20.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 20:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Neno hili silo hivyo; lakini mtu mmoja wa milima ya Efraimu, jina lake, Sheba, mwana wa Bikri, ameinua mkono wake juu ya mfalme, naam, Daudi, basi mtoeni yeye tu, nami nitaondoka katika mji huu. Basi yule mwanamke akamwambia Yoabu, Tazama, kichwa chake utatupiwa juu ya ukuta. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.20.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.20.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 20:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "ECC.7.19"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Mhu 7:19",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "ECC.9.14"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "9:14",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Ndipo yule mwanamke akawaendea watu wote katika hekima yake. Nao wakamkata kichwa Sheba, mwana wa Bikri, wakamtupia Yoabu huko nje. Ndipo akapiga tarumbeta, nao wakatawanyika kutoka mjini kila mtu hemani kwake. Naye Yoabu akarudi mpaka Yerusalemu kwa mfalme.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.20.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.20.22"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
